@baseurl = http://localhost:5196

### Create order (201, same product twice -> one item with 3 units)
POST {{baseurl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": "jan",
  "street": "Main 1",
  "city": "Krakow",
  "state": "",
  "country": "Poland",
  "zipCode": "30-001",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "productName": "Mug", "unitPrice": 9.99, "units": 2 },
    { "productId": 1, "productName": "Mug", "unitPrice": 9.99, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Invalid units (400 from domain)
POST {{baseurl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": "jan",
  "street": "Main 1",
  "city": "Krakow",
  "state": "",
  "country": "Poland",
  "zipCode": "30-001",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "productName": "Mug", "unitPrice": 9.99, "units": 0 }
  ]
}

### Cancel order
PUT {{baseurl}}/api/orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

### Cancel non-existent order
PUT {{baseurl}}/api/orders/999/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

### Get order (200)
GET {{baseurl}}/api/orders/1

### Get non-existent order (404)
GET {{baseurl}}/api/orders/999

### Get orders by buyer jan
GET {{baseurl}}/api/orders?buyerId=jan